A kitchen note on arranging clean cups on a shelf: “Keep the front row of cups in front of the shelf. This way, you can easily grab a cup from the front row without having to move other cups out of the way. It also makes it easier to clean the cups without having to reach in the back or get everything mixed up. Try it out and you will see the difference!”
